# Candidate B: cancellation-safe first TwoSum plus one full fixed N=4
# MultiFloats-style renormalization pass.

variable b
variable a1
variable a2
variable a3

two_sum      b a1
two_sum      a1 a2
two_sum      a2 a3
two_sum      b a1
two_sum      a1 a2
fast_two_sum a2 a3

# One _renorm_pass for N=4: (1,2), (3,4), then (2,3).
two_sum b a1
two_sum a2 a3
two_sum a1 a2

prove b strongly_dominates a1
prove a1 strongly_dominates a2
prove a2 strongly_dominates a3
